<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38494" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπείρομαι</span></b> , inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-είρεσθαι</span>
		v.l. in
		<i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			7.101
		</span></i>, al.: impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-είρετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.22
				</span></i>
			, al.: fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ειρήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.67
				</span></i>
			, al.: used by 
				Att.
			 only in fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ερήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					98
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pl.</u>
				32
			</span></i>, and aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ηρόμην,</span>
			inf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ερέσθαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				557
			</span></i> (prob.), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.29
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				Ion.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπειρέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.19
				</span></i>
			, al.:—<i>ask besides</i> or <i>again,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.3.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.
			pers., <i>ask</i> or <i>question</i> him <i>besides,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i>about</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				98
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.101
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.158
				</span></i>
			; with relat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὅ τι σιτέεται ὁ βασιλεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅντινα τρόπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.161
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp.
				<i>inquire of</i> a god, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν θεόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπήροντο τὸν θεόν, εἰ παραδοῖεν . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπερησόμενος ᾠχόμην ὡς τὸν θεόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπεμπον τὴν ἐς θεὸν ἐπειρησομένους
					τὸν χῶρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.67
				</span></i>
			; <i>question</i> a person, <i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>ask</i> the people <i>for</i> their opinion, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γνώμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ax.</u>
					368d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				22.5
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
